  P("It's bound to ...","Mutlaka ... olacak","C1","","It's bound to rain this weekend.","Bu hafta sonu mutlaka yağmur yağacak.",("Should we take umbrellas?","Yes. ___ rain. The sky is very dark.",["There's little chance that ...","It's highly unlikely that ..."])),
