  P("Maybe ...","Belki ...","A2","","Maybe we will go to the beach on Sunday.","Belki pazar günü plaja gideriz.",("What are you doing on Sunday?","I'm not sure. ___ we will go to the beach.",["I'm positive (that) ...","There's no doubt that ..."])),
