  P("It's just possible that ...","... olması pekâlâ mümkün (ama zor)","C1","","It's just possible that we will finish early.","Erken bitirmemiz pekâlâ mümkün.",("Can we finish before noon?","___ we will finish early, but don't count on it.",["There's no doubt that ...","Without a doubt, ..."])),
  P("For all I know, ...","Bildiğim kadarıyla, ... (bilmiyorum, olabilir)","C1","","For all I know, she has already left.","Bildiğim kadarıyla, çoktan gitmiş olabilir.",("Is Maria still in the office?","I haven't seen her. ___ she has already left.",["I'm positive (that) ...","There's no doubt that ..."])),
